## Datasets

- `data/input.txt` — the `names.txt` list from `karpathy/makemore`
  (<https://github.com/karpathy/makemore>), commit `988aa59`. Byte-identical to
  the upstream file. Karpathy's `makemore` is released under the MIT License.
- `data/shakespeare.txt` — the canonical "Tiny Shakespeare" character-level
  corpus (40,000 lines) used in `karpathy/char-rnn`. The text is William
  Shakespeare's, in the public domain.

## Third-party runtime dependencies

The visualizer depends on open-source packages, each under its own license
(React, Vite, Tailwind, Shiki, KaTeX, dagre, Vitest, Playwright, Pyodide). None
of their source is vendored here. Run `npm ls --all` inside `visualizer/` for
the resolved tree, or see the lockfile.
